The agent sends mail by running:

```bash
python3 {baseDir}/send_email.py "recipient@example.com" "Subject" "Body text"
```

With attachment:

```bash
python3 {baseDir}/send_email.py "recipient@example.com" "Subject" "Body" "/path/to/file.pdf"

